s canon fans could see toby  maguire and andrew garfield's characters  again that being said remy is making his  return to the genre with the upcoming  doctor strange and a multiverse of  madness which is rumored to include a  lot of multiverse characters including  toby maguire's spider-man so there are a  couple things unpacked here one of the  writers for the canceled spider-man 4  said um they brought in some other  riders they changed things and then the  film just ended up not happening so i  wonder if this was some type of studio  intervention so the studio came in  changed some things up and then they  possibly couldn't agree on some story  elements or they wanted to change some  things and parties weren't happy then it  just got cancelled perhaps the studio  just decided that the script wasn't  working or what they wanted to do wasn't  working so then they just cancelled it  and then rebooted the franchise with the  amazing spider-man but they definitely  have a lot of ideas for the fourth  spider-man film but perhaps with  spider-man no way home coming out  they're gonna have to change some things  up if we are going to see a fourth  spider-man film in one of my previous  videos i've actually mentioned some  rumors of a fourth spider-man film being  spoken about behind the scenes and  looking like it could be in production  it's a fingers crossed but um again take  this with a large grain of salt  personally i would love to see the  fourth spider-man film take place after  no way home so we'll see toby maguire  play an older spider-man this does mean  the original script for spider-man 4  probably or most likely cannot be used  perhaps some story elements they can use  and repurpose but they probably would  have to go in a different direction but  as long as sam remy is involved i'll be  happy with whatever they do so tell me  what you guys think in the comment  section below do you wish that we saw  the original spider-man 4 or do you  think it was a good